  "prefLabel": "He-M 520.07 Limitation of Services",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-12-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 520.07 Limitation of Services. Financial assistance provided under these rules shall be provided to the extent that funds for this purpose are appropriated and made available to the bureau by the Legislature and not otherwise reduced or restricted by legislative fiscal committee action.\n\nSource. #9748-A, eff 7-1-10; ss by #12558, INTERIM, eff 6-26-18, EXPIRED: 12-24-18\n\nNew. #12699, eff 12-28-18",
